Adapted files:

  lib/src/embedding.dart (speakerSimilarity, requireSpeakerSimilarity)
    from packages/cc_domain/lib/core/domain/services/cosine_similarity.dart
    The cosine-similarity kernel is unchanged, with the length check replaced
    by an embedding-space check and the result clamped to the cosine range.

The voice-profile matcher that used to sit here (VoiceProfile, bestVoiceMatch,
blendCentroid and friends, adapted from cc_domain's voice_profile_matching.dart)
moved to transcript_kit in the sibling conversation-kit-dart workspace before
this package released it; its attribution travels with it in that package's
NOTICE.
